    "overview": "Every page is set like a page of an antique botanical magazine — cover, spreads, contents page, captioned plates. Aged ivory paper, olive fields owning whole regions, wine as the single hot accent, soot type and double hairlines. Imagery is raster vintage botanical illustration, collaged with slight rotations and paper shadows; never code-drawn.",
